  "note": "Selection at week t uses weeks 0..t-1 only. The 28-day carbon band and the arrival reserve are causal within each week. Demand is the single real Azure week (disclosed; exp031 tests shape sensitivity). The one-sided conformal lower bound on next week's saving is distribution-free given exchangeable weeks; carbon seasonality makes that approximate, so the bound is reported beside the mean, not as a guarantee."
}
